<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown rated a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said it initiated coverage of Tom Brown Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 22-1/2 in late morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
